{"id":"n80171-1-8","stage":4,"title":"찢기다 · 被撕","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80171-1-8-1","ko":"바지가 왜 다 찢겼어?","zh":"裤子怎么全撕坏了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바지가","meaning":"裤子","explanation":"바지：裤子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"바지","audio":"/audio/fb24dd66a8c8c7dd42d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66249","senseId":"1","lemma":"바지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바지가","audio":"/audio/74fad887697f8c193bd3.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"찢겼어?","meaning":"被撕，被扯","explanation":"찢기다：被撕，被扯；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"찢기다","audio":"/audio/f447523e02a82b7d54c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80171","senseId":"1","lemma":"찢기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찢겼어","audio":"/audio/82c03c6c931d15ac8403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fb24dd66a8c8c7dd","term":"바지","zh":"裤子","audio":"/audio/fb24dd66a8c8c7dd42d1.mp3","entryId":"66249","definition":"穿在下身的衣物，上面为筒状，下面是可以放腿的两条分叉。","pronunciation":["바지"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"f447523e02a82b7d","term":"찢기다","zh":"被撕，被扯","audio":"/audio/f447523e02a82b7d54c6.mp3","entryId":"80171","definition":"物体被拉拽而裂开。","pronunciation":["찓끼다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ecc885d1e64cbfd9df96.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n80171-1-8-2","ko":"급하게 뛰어다니다가 넘어졌지 뭐야.","zh":"就是刚才跑得太急，结果摔倒了呗。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"급하게","meaning":"急忙，急切，急促","explanation":"급하다：急忙，急切，急促；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"급하다","audio":"/audio/5c52cd24e00b6dba18be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86862","senseId":"2","lemma":"급하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"급하게","audio":"/audio/cf24bba2f542d174a4d0.mp3"}},{"text":"뛰어다니다가","meaning":"跑来跑去","explanation":"뛰어다니다：跑来跑去；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"뛰어다니다","audio":"/audio/3c269b03bbb72b7f029d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62374","senseId":"1","lemma":"뛰어다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뛰어다니다가","audio":"/audio/9ae352869665785e11a9.mp3"}},{"text":"넘어졌지","meaning":"跌倒，倒下，摔倒","explanation":"넘어지다：跌倒，倒下，摔倒；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"넘어지다","audio":"/audio/b95cf11ab79489dac5a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62363","senseId":"1","lemma":"넘어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넘어졌지","audio":"/audio/133d574deaec185e4cae.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐야.","meaning":"什么，怎么回事","explanation":"뭐：什么，怎么回事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐야","audio":"/audio/4ec8ab9dc5310ffa76e8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5c52cd24e00b6dba","term":"급하다","zh":"急忙，急切，急促","audio":"/audio/5c52cd24e00b6dba18be.mp3","entryId":"86862","definition":"做事匆促，没有闲暇。","pronunciation":["그파다"]},{"id":"3c269b03bbb72b7f","term":"뛰어다니다","zh":"跑来跑去","audio":"/audio/3c269b03bbb72b7f029d.mp3","entryId":"62374","definition":"到处来来回回地跑。","pronunciation":["뛰어다니다","뛰여다니다"]},{"id":"b95cf11ab79489da","term":"넘어지다","zh":"跌倒，倒下，摔倒","audio":"/audio/b95cf11ab79489dac5a0.mp3","entryId":"62363","definition":"站立着的人或物失去重心，倾向一边而倒下。","pronunciation":["너머지다"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么，怎么回事","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"对于已经发生的意外事件或状况，强调自己的惊讶、后悔、遗憾的话。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/ed10dbeb9638bc56cc31.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.598,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=80171","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":129,"sequenceScore":2.4247,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["就是刚才跑得太急，结果摔倒了呗。","裤子怎么全撕坏了？","好久不见了。我们已经有二十年没见了吧？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["裤子怎么全撕坏了？","好久不见了。我们已经有二十年没见了吧？","就是刚才跑得太急，结果摔倒了呗。"],"answer":2}]}
